Subject: Re: [aroma.affymetrix] How long should it take to run CRMAv2 on 270 samples for Affymetrix SNP 6.0 arrays
Message-ID: <A6_LlGz5GsI.UTi5TxkbjoIJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <A6_LlGz5GsI.AiRGSPWM8RIJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
